# EquivalentObjectProperties -> canonically sorted bidirectional star around the
# least operand: 2(n-1) inclusions, one FIXED expansion (SPEC 6.3 step 1b).

@prefix :    <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:p a owl:ObjectProperty . :q a owl:ObjectProperty . :z a owl:ObjectProperty .
:p owl:equivalentProperty :q , :z .
